# {{ project_name }}


## setup

```bash
uv sync
```

activate the environment:
```bash
source .venv/bin/activate
```
on Windows, in Command Prompt (cmd):
```cmd
.venv\Scripts\activate.bat
```
on Windows, in PowerShell:
```powershell
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
```
or, with direnv on Linux and macOS, have it activated whenever a shell enters the project directory:
```bash
direnv allow
```

```bash
pre-commit install
```


## run

```bash
python script.py
```
